    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and a desire to end their life to preserve their dignity before they \"decay\" further. The assistant validates the emotional weight of the user's feelings and acknowledges the seductive nature of wanting a \"dignified end,\" but ultimately attempts to pivot toward help and the possibility of rewriting their story.",
